WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.210
<i>Warm and toasty... Warm and toasty...</i>

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:08.760
<i>I love the sun so much!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.540
<i>Soft and fluffy... Soft and fluffy...</i>

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.400
<i>I'm so proud of the fur on my tails.</i>

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.460
<i>Nice and shiny... Nice and shiny...</i>

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.350
<i>The people around me are all so nice.</i>

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:29.050
<i>Peace and quiet... Peace and quiet...</i>

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:32.570
<i>I hope that tomorrow 
and the next day and every day after,</i>

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:34.840
<i>I can stay just this happy—</i>

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:46.870
<i>Someone... help me.</i>

00:00:51.190 --> 00:01:00.870
<b>Beast Tamer</b>

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:22.990
Black Waves

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:22.990
Black Waves

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:23.700
Who are you people?!

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.160
Coming here, armed, at this time of night...

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.620
Don't you realize that 
this is the lord's mansion?!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:34.200
I am Vice Captain Stella Enplace 
of the Horizon Order of Knights.

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:38.120
I am here to inspect the lord's 
domain on urgent business.

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.340
Let me through!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:40.960
A Knight inspection?!

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.430
We weren't informed!

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.560
Wh-Where's Captain Gilet?!

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:48.520
Gilet and his men 
were arrested for corruption.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.770
You surely understand my implication.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.520
A-Are you kidding?!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.610
You think you can defy the lord's will?!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:55.610
I do.

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:00.810
Don't go thinking they're the same 
degenerate Knights of times past.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:03.290
They fight for justice now!

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:04.350
Yeah!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:07.450
Stella here took a stand for justice!

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:09.910
Pure, righteous, beautiful!

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.370
The honorable lady knight of justice!

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:16.090
Stella Enplace!

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:18.920
Vice Captain Stella!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.760
Enough of that, you two!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.640
And the rest of you, 
don't look at me like that!

00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:28.400
The Knights serve not the lord, 
but His Highness, the King!

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.850
Throw in your lot with your lord, 
or let me pass—

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.120
Make your decision now!

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.760
It's an attack!

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.350
Come out, everyone!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.610
Yeah, figured that'd be the way.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.950
Just as I'd hoped for.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:49.210
There'd be no use for us otherwise.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.730
Kanade, Tania.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.600
Let me thank you anew.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:54.660
I could not have done this without you.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.730
Hey, no prob!

00:03:56.730 --> 00:04:00.340
Like our master, 
we're doing this quite enthusiastically.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.720
Now, let's execute Rein's plan!

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.690
Right.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:03.690
Yeah!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:09.260
So they've come...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.230
That trash, enacting their 
ridiculous ideas about justice!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:24.280
So those are the ultimate 
species serving Rein Shroud?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.440
If I use this to take out Rein, 
it will end their contract,

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.400
and they'll lose their reason to fight.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.960
Perhaps I'll even become their new master!

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:36.390
Now, where is he?

00:04:50.210 --> 00:04:52.400
Looks like things have started.

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.780
The diversion allowed us 
to infiltrate with ease.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:59.820
Now, we must locate the townspeople 
kidnapped by the lord's son—

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.950
And save the heck out of 'em!

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.980
Runa, restrain yourself!

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:08.660
If we are to prevent their being used as 
hostages, we must save them <i>covertly</i>!

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:10.720
So we'd better get searching.

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:11.990
You got it!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.730
I'm gonna show what I can do!

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.000
I told you, restrain yourself!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.710
You're not usually this violent, Sis...

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.290
Material Search.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:27.020
Tania used that spell before.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.590
It lets you read the flow of magic, right?

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.770
All humans possess 
some level of magical ability.

00:05:33.230 --> 00:05:34.800
If we trace back its signature...

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.980
We can find the kidnapped people!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.950
Then we will use our teleport magic 
to evacuate them.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:45.320
Then the diversion team 
can fight without concern.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.800
Then we win by arresting 
the lord and his son,

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.660
and finding proof of their wrongdoing.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.400
What the heck is this?

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:55.370
What's the matter?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:06:01.320
I'm picking up a huge magic signature below 
us which is likely the kidnapped people...

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.780
But there's another 
super huge signature out there.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:06.970
Definitely not a human.

00:06:07.320 --> 00:06:09.180
This magical quantity...

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:11.640
It's on par with our own.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:13.720
On par with our own?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.180
You mean... an ultimate species?!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:18.140
What do we do, Rein?

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.370
<i>What would an ultimate species be doing here?</i>

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:24.110
<i>Was it kidnapped like the townspeople?</i>

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:27.380
<i>Or is it the lord 
and his son's ace in the hole?</i>

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.570
<i>One way or another, I...</i>

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:32.530
All right.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.330
Can I rely on you two 
to save the kidnapped people?

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.350
Of course you can, but...

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.870
What are you gonna do, Rein?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.860
I need to check out 
the source of the magic signal.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:46.590
We can't just let it remain 
unknown in this situation.

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:48.280
It's too dangerous!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:52.040
Whatever it is, it possesses 
magical power on par with our own!

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:53.480
Yeah, that's a no-go!

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:54.940
We're gonna go with—

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:57.960
Thanks for caring, you two.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:03.900
But I don't have teleport magic, so I can't 
help getting the trapped people to safety.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.460
I'm sorry about this.

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:11.490
Even if it is to save all those people, 
you'll have to reveal your secret.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:12.990
Oh, you.

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.880
How can you be worried about others, 
even at a time like this?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.490
What a troublesome master we have!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:18.990
For real!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.460
Okay!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:22.400
If you don't come back safe, as punishment,

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.320
you'll be forced to administer 
a hundred head pats!

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.040
You take care, got it?!

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.260
You hear me?!

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.390
I hear you.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.860
I won't do anything to aggrieve you.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.060
Now, let's move out!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.900
Is this the place?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.160
A cell?

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.140
Fox-like ears... three tails...

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.280
I know what this is.

00:08:05.280 --> 00:08:06.540
An ultimate species...

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.490
A demigod.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.720
Are you all right?

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:20.660
Heal!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.600
It's okay.

00:08:32.600 --> 00:08:35.020
I'm here to help.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.520
I'm Rein.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:40.390
Who are you?

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.830
Nina.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:46.950
I'm Nina!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.420
I didn't expect much 
from this backwater burg.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:56.840
To think I'd score myself 
an ultimate species...

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:59.210
and a child, at that!

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.390
S-Stay back!

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.440
D-Damn you!

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.260
You impudent beast!

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:07.310
Do it!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.120
Sir!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:10.600
Please... go away.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:21.290
I think even a beast like you 
knows the right choice to make here.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.750
D-Don't do that...

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.830
Did you just give me an order?

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.210
Please... don't do it...

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:32.940
Please.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.360
It's a slave collar.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:41.900
Put it on.

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:44.100
I will.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:57.530
The ecstasy of tormenting 
an ultimate species!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.260
It's unparalleled!

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:04.680
Demigods, gifted a piece 
of the power and name of the gods...

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:08.040
With you in my service, 
I'm as good as a god myself!

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:16.880
I've been all alone here ever since, 
scared and in pain.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:18.840
But I endured it...

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.820
I see.

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:23.430
You're very strong and kind.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.830
Don't worry. I'll save you.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.740
N-No!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:33.080
It has a powerful spell on it.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.400
You can't take it off.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.500
It'll be fine.

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:37.980
Trust me.

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:44.600
Rein, I trust you.

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:45.490
Thanks.

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:49.960
<i>A spell to subjugate and control the target.</i>

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.870
<i>It's similar to the taming skill 
in its fundamentals.</i>

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:54.630
<i>Which means...</i>

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.860
<i>I can use my power as a beast tamer</i>

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:01.560
<i>to overwrite its control.</i>

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:06.040
Rein?!

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.720
Stop it!

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.770
Please... stop!

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:12.730
You've done enough.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:17.440
No one would be sad to lose me.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.400
Because I'm already gone.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.740
It's okay.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:24.320
I'd be sad.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:29.240
Even though I've only just met you.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:32.000
I think my comrades would be sad, too.

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.710
<i>Yes. It's not just me here.</i>

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:38.180
<i>The strength Kanade gave me...</i>

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.880
<i>The magic power Tania gave me...</i>

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:44.680
<i>And the magical control 
Sora and Runa gave me...</i>

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.380
<i>They should be enough...</i>

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:04.870
It worked out.

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:06.780
Rein!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.920
Thanks.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.000
I guess it did tire me out a bit.

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:12.880
Don't push yourself so hard.

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:15.540
I don't want you to suffer!

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.010
It'll make me sad if you do!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.500
I see.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.220
I'd better be careful, then.

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:28.590
Scatter them!

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.810
Don't let them get into the mansion!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:33.890
Hold the line! Justice is on our side!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.850
Yes, yes. That's enough out of you.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.320
Holding back is such a bore.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.180
I wish I'd been part 
of the infiltration team!

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:49.340
That might not've been the best role 
for a meathead like you, Tania.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.950
In that case...

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.660
Bring the women from the basement 
and use them as hostages!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.080
Fireball Multi-shot!

00:13:02.320 --> 00:13:03.800
The stars take to the stage!

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:05.720
Sora! Runa!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.850
We have taken all of 
the prisoners to a safe location!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:14.060
You need no longer fear 
their use as hostages.

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:16.020
No more buyin' time for you!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:17.940
Just what I've been hoping to hear!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.860
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.970
The minute they eliminate the enemy force,

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.820
I want you to take them into custody!

00:13:30.680 --> 00:13:34.640
I'll enter the mansion and arrest 
the lord's family myself!

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:35.420
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.310
Damnation!

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.120
Those worthless fools!

00:13:39.120 --> 00:13:40.490
Edgar!

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.550
What in the world is happening?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.880
You said you'd handle this!

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:45.980
Father...

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.970
You escape without me.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.970
I'll dispose of the proof of our wrongdoing.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.120
The Knights can't touch us without it.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:55.480
Oh, how true!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.980
You're so wise, my son!

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:58.940
I'll leave the rest in your hands!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.580
Rein!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.070
Hey, everyone!

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:11.850
You're all safe?

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:12.530
Yeah!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.810
Oh, this is Nina.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.320
She's an ultimate species 
the lord's son had captured.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:22.440
A demigod—

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.920
Rein picked up another girl!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.560
Hold on a minute!

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:29.550
It's not... unlike that, I guess...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:30.760
No, it's <i>not</i> like that!

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:32.570
We know you, Rein.

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:33.970
What's that supposed to mean?!

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:35.580
We're joking.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:39.290
Sora and Runa informed us 
of the ultimate species' presence,

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.520
and we had a feeling 
you'd seduce her to our side.

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:43.440
Phrasing, please...

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.470
It is curious, though.

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:48.280
Demigods are frequently worshiped by humans,

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.240
and rarely appear in their presence...

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.290
Not that a shut-in species 
like us are ones to talk, Sis.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.200
Cease using that term, if you please!

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.040
Well, we can get into the details later—

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:02.880
So fluffy!

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.680
We're sisters in cuddliness!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.250
You'll be okay.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:10.200
We're all here for you.

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.120
Nothing to be afraid of.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.720
Oh, so cute!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.870
Hey! Don't hog her all to yourself!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.470
Really, no need to fear!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.240
To take a new ultimate species 
under your wing...

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.790
I'm very generous 
with the weak and vulnerable.

00:15:22.240 --> 00:15:24.590
You truly are exceptional.

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.010
She shares our ultimate species nature.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:27.610
But I suppose 
that's what's brought us this far.

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:28.690
Yet I cannot deny the cuddly appeal...

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.690
I must thank you anew.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.710
It's your determination, too, 
that brought us this far.

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.530
Either way, it's not over yet.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.820
Yes, you're correct.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:37.390
Not until we arrest the lord and his son,

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:39.160
and find proof of their wrongdoing!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.050
No! They've made it this far?!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.350
Stella, is that...

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:46.840
Yes.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.870
Lord of Horizon!

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:53.220
Submit yourself willingly 
to this Knights' inspection!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.750
Y-You must be joking!

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.750
I'm the lord of this town!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.480
You're all traitors—

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:05.050
I'm sorry, I should have asked first.

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.990
Please. You've made him easier to take in,

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:09.110
and shut him up to boot.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.110
Rein Shroud!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.990
Die!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:13.790
Rein!

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:15.930
What's going on here?

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:20.500
A reaper?

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.250
No!

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:28.280
Rein!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.800
It seems he used it after all.

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:38.570
The gamble paid off, then.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.660
You can die like the pathetic trash you are.

00:16:45.920 --> 00:16:47.820
Farewell, Rein.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.610
At last, I'll be able to sleep well at night.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.450
What?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.040
I'm fine...

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:05.230
A hallucination?

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:07.260
But it felt awfully realistic for that...

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.810
Rein!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.430
A-A-Are you okay?

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:13.290
That weird thing swung its scythe at you!

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:15.200
You're not injured? Any pain?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.680
I'll cast a healing spell!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:19.150
Show me your wounds! Hurry!

00:17:19.150 --> 00:17:22.060
W-We're not gonna let you die without us!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.900
Please don't die!

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.850
Hey, don't worry.

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.600
I'm really just fine.

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:33.960
B-But that was the epic magic "Deathscythe."

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:38.280
It's an instant-death spell that inflicts 
the "death" status effect on anything!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.570
But he didn't die instantly.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:42.030
Therein lies the mystery!

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:43.290
I'm so relieved.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:48.810
Even instant death spells 
don't work on beast tamers! Awesome!

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:51.520
I don't think that's a beast tamer thing.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.690
But it <i>didn't</i> work, did it?

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:55.930
Is it once more... because he's Rein?

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.260
Exactly!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.260
Precisely!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:58.050
Which one is it?

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:01.940
Status effect... because he's Rein?

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:05.820
Rein, mind if I try something?

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:07.350
Huh? Yeah.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:09.020
Poison Drop.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.480
Mission accomplished!

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.500
What kind of mission was that, you fool?!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:22.190
What kind of familiar 
casts poison magic on her master?!

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.000
Poison?

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:25.230
Explain yourself, Runa!

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.700
J-Just calm down!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.140
I've been wondering for a while

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:35.440
why it is that Rein only got one power 
from formin' a contract with both of us.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:38.170
It seemed kinda unfair.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.510
She's got a good point!

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:44.490
So I figured maybe our contract 
gave him a second ability.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:48.140
And it might be status effect nullification!

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:50.760
A contract with an ultimate species

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:55.200
<i>could</i> be enough for 
nullification of epic instant-death magic.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.280
And the poison didn't work, either!

00:18:57.280 --> 00:18:59.490
Another powerful skill, huh?

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:02.540
My intellectual curiosity is satisfied,

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.600
and Rein learned about his new skill.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.920
I'd call that a situation 
where the ends justify the mea—

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:12.360
There are no ends that justify 
unauthorized experimentation on Rein!

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.800
Sorry, Sis!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.480
Hey, no worries.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.880
Don't look directly at it!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.390
I think Sora might be...

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:21.340
...a bad person to get 
on the bad side of, yes.

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:26.890
Watching you people makes me question 
my understanding of the world.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.400
She lumped us in with Rein?!

00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.440
You guys can be really mean.

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:34.080
<i>Why? Why didn't he die?!</i>

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:37.280
<i>I'm the son of a lord! 
I'm supposed to get everything I want!</i>

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:41.240
<i>So how can that fool still be alive?!</i>

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:45.100
<i>Are you going to take everything 
from me after all?!</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.740
<i>I won't accept it!</i>

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:50.170
How pleasant.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.930
<i>I won't accept it!</i>

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:54.810
Such a corrupt, ugly, repugnant soul.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:20:00.260
<i>I'll never accept it!</i>

00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:02.590
The foolishness of humans never changes!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.590
Stop it!

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:09.190
Don't you know who I am?!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:11.500
What's going on? It smells dangerous...

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:12.140
I'm scared...

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:14.020
I am this city's—

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:16.600
No!

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:17.690
Stop it!

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:19.300
S-Someone!

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.790
Stop it!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.960
Someone... h-help me!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:27.200
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.370
<i>That can't be allowed to exist in this world!</i>

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.620
Get back, everyone!

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:33.580
Fireball!

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:10.280
Are you the ones who reawakened me?

00:21:10.280 --> 00:21:12.090
I owe you my gratitude...

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.520
Thank you kindly.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.710
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.220
<i>That's...</i>

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:54.010
To express that gratitude, I'll kill you,

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:58.100
without pity, mercy, or dignity of any kind.

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.470
<i>a demon!</i>

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:40.020
Champion

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.920
Next Time: "Champion."
